---
import SectionKicker from "../presentation/SectionKicker.astro";
---

<section class="section wrap" id="about">
  <SectionKicker index="02" label="Editorial Profile" />
  <h2>About me</h2>
  <blockquote>
    “I have been working as a frontend developer for almost 10 years and I have learnt that
    join a team and get involved in a digital project, make it bigger or help to make it better,
    make sure that the product follows the design, deliver the best user experience to the
    final user and explore new technologies that allow me do more with less, is what I love.”
  </blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>10 Years Experience</li>
    <li>Barcelona, Spain</li>
    <li>Design Systems & User Experience</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-bottom: 5.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  blockquote {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.4rem 1.8rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  li {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--green);
  }
</style>
